  "contentId": "1229067305",
  "title": "POI名称涉领导人敏感词处置流程",
  "body": "<table data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-d7368fa8-91af-4f0b-b28f-6682ffeec1de\"><tbody><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-OtPcTxfA\"><th data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-e930a2df-4cd5-47e5-b5f3-9a7409700623\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-a85267c5-b727-49e6-a30f-52b55b0db6ee\">一级标签</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-8902f690-90c5-47ce-bc5a-34c3e731839c\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-89125787-f69d-43d3-bc15-9eec0fe4e013\">二级标签</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"140\" width=\"140\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-a2251281-3fd9-4a47-afeb-21eb6c5ed2c5\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8e00bed0-356d-4fbd-b716-3f9756665265\">三级标签</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"196\" width=\"196\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-77ff292a-b1dd-4fee-8326-f2dd3aab0473\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8d7e69f2-73d6-4edc-b575-fe092f162421\">风险点</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"364\" width=\"364\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-66be5dd8-f1ba-48c6-b3b8-995d0cc47e80\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-02cc097f-100e-43af-8fe3-59c8fe53b019\">具体定义</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"356\" width=\"356\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-9615e369-7573-411b-a47b-1fd8c22ed426\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5c3c3184-3868-44d8-97b2-f36f1b8869d7\">文字样本</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"748\" width=\"748\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-fe0fa010-d8b4-4e11-bc8d-80bd1f2b9334\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-a631545a-03c6-4248-8067-5545dc242b39\">图片样本</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"488\" width=\"488\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-d13f9e8b-fae3-4204-87f2-84ed2cdcf7d8\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-900cb41c-a10f-428b-baed-7c5a136c88d1\">备注</p></th></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-Pn2bkyHZ\"><td data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-b449fd48-4144-4685-9a5d-88be9d6bed0c\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-dec6129b-10c9-4d83-a424-b3398e5ca577\">涉政</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-70cdf015-6857-4ffb-a4e6-27b854f4cd56\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-b5ef2bbb-9462-4a91-a5da-583bcec4357d\">涉政人物</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"140\" width=\"140\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-b8e13537-3982-4147-9359-8a584a77c04e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8f4a31d2-d00c-47aa-be44-3547fe885953\">一号、国家领导人</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"196\" width=\"196\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-2d3a447c-2ae3-4aa8-8eba-31e0e5a2c5cf\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7733ce12-c406-46ca-a78d-847dd54d9096\">商户名称涉现任国家领导人</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"364\" width=\"364\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-02091f7d-0690-493b-8490-03426147bb9f\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0cb07529-c57b-4364-9337-eabfe67788a9\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-e04a624e-39ed-4ce3-9d97-984f14edde71\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-96c460f8-6a56-4eb6-8645-fa4c40f0e648\">条件</p><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-97cd3e60-0b62-4bff-b3f0-63aec6493b68\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-d2ea29e5-a7d2-4603-92c3-77618e1e9d5b\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-66fd58f4-73c7-4b49-aacf-03ec209ddd2b\">商户名称（或部分）与一号及其夫人、女儿全名（或名）完全相同的；</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-2762d0a6-f250-46cd-97c8-78acde153ad8\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-e7111ede-58de-4108-bd8e-2b3a606196bc\">商户名称（或部分）与一号及其夫人、女儿全名同音或近音的；</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-66384988-1464-494f-bff4-ea94f5c7613e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cd0e9b5c-ec5e-4151-82ca-132bd29d92ec\">商户名称（或部分）与毛、邓、江、胡全名完全相同或同音或近音的；</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-7721ff4b-4860-4a6a-b726-49812eb9d896\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c34b4305-df13-4e2c-8e8d-4491cc4e5504\">商户名称（或部分）与其他国家领导人全名完全相同的，其中包括：周恩来、朱德、陈云、刘少奇、杨尚昆、胡耀邦、李克强、栗战书、汪洋、王沪宁、赵乐际、韩正；</p></li></ul></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-0cdae0e6-1fa2-499e-8546-65a528603bbb\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-714da5eb-a099-4350-bc6d-3f06f4a388dc\">处置：</p><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-70108305-112f-48c7-9623-42cc29b488cb\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-d0469496-454f-4289-9d1d-ee03ace5f7b9\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2a66f59e-b0e5-4bf1-88c0-0e9d42c1ed97\">合作商家：</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-12f86300-de60-4932-b877-dad5cb54957b\">由所涉业务侧核实其营业执照上登记注册公司名称：</p><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cd5d4c4f-958c-4c68-9da8-e44e35a53dda\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-286d8f64-66f8-49a2-82ef-7831be5766f2\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cd268f59-4834-4b7b-875d-cd8384cba39c\">若确含有敏感词字段，</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6e6ba796-7670-4a78-9ff2-0da42df69c98\">则商家名称保留，商家下评论存量全部人审，增量进高危队列。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-7b888ef0-f6a3-4ac3-8e0a-493d082dbb0e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-12466697-a1d5-4001-a947-339acbfb57fc\">若不含敏感词字段，</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-66eefc54-9b02-4768-a21d-922cc66ae95e\">则重置商家名称，商家下评论存量全部人审，增量进高危队列。</p></li></ul></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-8ef7e739-708f-414b-ba7c-5c5c3585cfe9\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-3363dfee-6ffe-427c-a418-302c76fd4fa5\">非合作商家：</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-01b85792-2da9-4470-9a4d-da3f1e1fb1b7\">先重置其商家名称信息，业务方跟进核实其营业执照上登记注册公司的名称：</p><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4cb7e9c4-a6e1-4fbf-8790-e9bde96c14a8\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-286d8f64-66f8-49a2-82ef-7831be5766f2\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-44fa6c60-edf6-4b44-a0d3-5c4bd8d2b09f\">若确含有敏感词字段，</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-f2a2ebe9-cc74-493a-aa87-c150da9a8e77\">则恢复商家名称，商家下评论存量全部人审，增量进高危队列。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-7b888ef0-f6a3-4ac3-8e0a-493d082dbb0e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-d56b6c82-248b-4b10-aca8-c1b7d48b7b54\">若不含敏感词字段或无法证实，</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-f04387cc-13bb-4d8a-a2f2-0d9dc00264c9\">则删除商家POI页。</p></li></ul></li></ul></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-c6a82f93-c80c-49e8-bbaa-6824f06a2339\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8a00d6ad-67b2-451e-827e-80d9c9e08aaf\">涉及领导人污称的商家名称按照涉政规则处置。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"356\" width=\"356\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-579bdbd8-aaea-4d1c-aff5-40558a10c6f5\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-113b20f3-edeb-4308-8c9e-4e1281c64fea\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-89d594a5-769c-4294-b354-7f8d9a525816\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0d2a5121-f8c9-4723-8728-de7c732e34cf\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">近平超市</span><br><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">ID:82527599</span><br><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">杭州近平汽配</span><br><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">ID:112690585</span><br><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">近平贸易有限公司</span><br><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">ID:44066882</span><br><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">南京近平食品贸易有限公司</span><br><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">ID:123121506</span><br><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">诸暨市近平山泉水厂</span><br><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">ID:1625063399</span><br><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">红多兹酒店-近平富MM梅加市场</span><br><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">ID:1351154543</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-b32d1198-9f24-4f6b-bff3-82fb9a78d828\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-da44d47f-65c0-435a-9142-6b0886190820\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">明泽观止烤肉馆；丽媛美容院等。</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"748\" width=\"748\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-404619ea-0f0d-4d9d-9024-146d9e982130\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cdd25aba-53e4-4fb3-b6a7-6321186ce81a\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"488\" width=\"488\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-3ef7ed85-9ac9-4fdf-98ba-9cea6bfc647a\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-f84da9a4-3543-484c-9446-6685d2c185c4\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-8LHZJ9oD\"><td data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-609fb149-9450-4af3-b5e3-af694db0a242\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-01bc1c4b-ff5f-44b0-b108-5d0b72b56d47\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-671c5bf7-9cdf-44e1-8ca3-ab4df114c009\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4be75953-14d4-4e6b-85c4-ab052afe7e8b\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"140\" width=\"140\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-f6c55c26-ff70-4611-9a1c-1637711bcbad\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-760bc8ad-672f-47a0-ab2e-695da7a47940\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"196\" width=\"196\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-d4ed89d3-5f7a-4c8e-b338-5f6352381f7c\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-dc08c0ae-b0a6-45a5-a37c-d5a6dbd3f02d\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"3